    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbafcStaffalsoa]{Staff}, Common</em></p><p>This wooden staff has 10 charges. While holding it, you can take a Magic action to expend 1 charge from the staff and cause a flower to sprout from a patch of earth or soil within 5 feet of yourself, or from the staff itself. Unless you choose a specific kind of flower, the staff creates a mild-scented daisy. The flower is harmless and nonmagical, and it grows or withers as a normal flower would.</p><p><strong>Regaining Charges.</strong> The staff regains 1d6 + 4 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, the staff turns into flower petals and is lost forever.</p>",
